  "dt2.13:0.2": "",
  "dt2.13:0.3": "asaṅgahitena sampayuttavippayuttapadaniddeso ",
  "dt2.13:1.1": "rūpakkhandhena ye dhammā khandhasaṅgahena asaṅgahitā āyatanasaṅgahena asaṅgahitā dhātusaṅgahena asaṅgahitā te dhammā katīhi khandhehi katīhāyatanehi katīhi dhātūhi sampayuttā. ",
  "dt2.13:1.2": "te dhammā tīhi khandhehi sampayuttā ",
  "dt2.13:1.3": "ekenāyatanena ekāya dhātuyā kehici sampayuttā. ",
  "dt2.13:1.4": "katīhi vippayuttā. ",
  "dt2.13:1.5": "ekena khandhena dasahāyatanehi dasahi dhātūhi vippayuttā ",
  "dt2.13:1.6": "ekenāyatanena ekāya dhātuyā kehici vippayuttā. ",
